    "name": "Tenebyss",
    "steam_appid": 3516100,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/6685974a286a4a5dc3bb511dc36ae4af.poster.avif?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/6685974a286a4a5dc3bb511dc36ae4af.webm?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/6685974a286a4a5dc3bb511dc36ae4af.mp4?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/52b3bd62bf9c7ac9cf2a4029328054f6.webp?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=31 /></span><strong>Tenebyss</strong> is a dark fantasy roguelike inspired by the iconic <i>Dark Souls</i> series, <i>Elden Ring</i>, and fast-paced roguelikes like <i>Risk of Rain 2</i> and <i>Hades with a little touch of the PS1 era charm</i>. It\u2019s a solo project currently being developed by <strong>Max Emelyanov</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, <strong>Tenebyss</strong> is a story-driven singleplayer roguelike focused on replayability, rich storytelling, looting, crafting, trading, and much more. Unlike most roguelikes, Tenebyss features a persistent inventory system\u2014so even when you fail a run, the gear and items you\u2019ve collected or crafted stay with you. This helps you feel a real sense of progression, without the frustration of starting from scratch every time. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/52b3bd62bf9c7ac9cf2a4029328054f6.webp?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/1ce4a1720049837395fd68e27cd383bd.avif?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=232 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/78333e436319ffdf2393763f4b7005af.poster.avif?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/78333e436319ffdf2393763f4b7005af.webm?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/78333e436319ffdf2393763f4b7005af.mp4?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/52b3bd62bf9c7ac9cf2a4029328054f6.webp?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=31 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Flow Of Combat -\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenebyss delivers fast-paced movement and combat, wrapped in a world full of mystery and danger. Whether you're exploring eerie environments, battling strange creatures, or looting powerful gear, every action keeps you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traversal and combat go hand-in-hand\u2014defeat enemies to gather loot that can be sold, crafted into new items, or equipped to enhance your build. The game encourages you to experiment and discover what playstyle works best for you.<br><br>Combat is flexible and built around your preferred playstyle. The game currently offers a variety of distinct weapon types to choose from(<strong>More will be added as the development continues</strong>):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Swords</strong> \u2013 swift and relentless</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greatsword</strong> \u2013 heavy, punishing strikes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greathammer</strong> \u2013 devastating, high-impact blows</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scythe</strong> \u2013 agile, sweeping attacks with reach</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Staff</strong> \u2013 ranged elemental power and spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon brings its own feel, strengths, and strategy\u2014letting you carve your path through the abyss, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/f1abd4dca7b100d3b11b0c66476ebcea.avif?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=232 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/0d79cc2b6a0dc0bc042102c0f77eb8ce.poster.avif?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/0d79cc2b6a0dc0bc042102c0f77eb8ce.webm?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/0d79cc2b6a0dc0bc042102c0f77eb8ce.mp4?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/52b3bd62bf9c7ac9cf2a4029328054f6.webp?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=31 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Inventory System -\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to use inventory system to carry all items, found loot and crafting items!<br>(The UI is yet to be updated)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Dungeons To Explore -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Tenebyss</strong>, you will have a huge number of dungeons to loot, explore, find secret areas and fight enemies and bosses. All of them are sorted by levels, get prepared before you head out to the next level dungeon! You will need to take care of your:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Sets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your inventory items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade your current items for a better ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe even sell them to open various chests throughout the dungeon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/1a4c4692358d4bb719a31eea00c08cad.avif?t=1748527503\" data-has-big width=800 height=418 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/6685974a286a4a5dc3bb511dc36ae4af.poster.avif?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/6685974a286a4a5dc3bb511dc36ae4af.webm?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/6685974a286a4a5dc3bb511dc36ae4af.mp4?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/52b3bd62bf9c7ac9cf2a4029328054f6.webp?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=31 /></span><strong>Tenebyss</strong> is a dark fantasy roguelike inspired by the iconic <i>Dark Souls</i> series, <i>Elden Ring</i>, and fast-paced roguelikes like <i>Risk of Rain 2</i> and <i>Hades with a little touch of the PS1 era charm</i>. It\u2019s a solo project currently being developed by <strong>Max Emelyanov</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, <strong>Tenebyss</strong> is a story-driven singleplayer roguelike focused on replayability, rich storytelling, looting, crafting, trading, and much more. Unlike most roguelikes, Tenebyss features a persistent inventory system\u2014so even when you fail a run, the gear and items you\u2019ve collected or crafted stay with you. This helps you feel a real sense of progression, without the frustration of starting from scratch every time. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/52b3bd62bf9c7ac9cf2a4029328054f6.webp?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"