lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greatsword</strong> \u2013 heavy, punishing strikes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greathammer</strong> \u2013 devastating, high-impact blows</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scythe</strong> \u2013 agile, sweeping attacks with reach</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Staff</strong> \u2013 ranged elemental power and spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon brings its own feel, strengths, and strategy\u2014letting you carve your path through the abyss, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/f1abd4dca7b100d3b11b0c66476ebcea.avif?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=232 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/0d79cc2b6a0dc0bc042102c0f77eb8ce.poster.avif?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/0d79cc2b6a0dc0bc042102c0f77eb8ce.webm?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/0d79cc2b6a0dc0bc042102c0f77eb8ce.mp4?t=1748527503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/52b3bd62bf9c7ac9cf2a4029328054f6.webp?t=1748527503\" width=800 height=31 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Inventory System -\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to use inventory system to carry all items, found loot and crafting items!<br>(The UI is yet to be updated)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Dungeons To Explore -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Tenebyss</strong>, you will have a huge number of dungeons to loot, explore, find secret areas and fight enemies and bosses. All of them are sorted by levels, get prepared before you head out to the next level dungeon! You will need to take care of your:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Sets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your inventory items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade your current items for a better ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe even sell them to open various chests throughout the dungeon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516100/extras/1a4c4692358d4bb719a31eea00c08cad.avif?t=1748527503\" data-has-big width=800 height=418 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Enter the world of Tenebyss, a dystopian gothic castles world that is flooded by thick mist and clouds. A world where Dark Souls and Risk Of Rain meet each other. Play alone or with friends, gather loot and prepare for your next dungeon!Customize your character and enchant your weapons.",
